OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F303A1764248508
OL,3,CUK weightlifter named world's
OL,4,Cstrongest woman as trans winner
OL,5,Cdisqualified
OL,7,FA UK weightlifter has been crowned the
OL,8,Fworld's strongest woman after it
OL,9,Femerged that the original winner was a
OL,10,Ftrans athlete and should not have been
OL,11,Fcompeting in the category.
OL,13,FAndrea Thompson finished second to the
OL,14,Fathlete at the Official Strongman
OL,15,FGames World Championships in Texas in
OL,16,Fthe US which took place over three
OL,17,Fdays starting on Friday.
OL,19,FThe games only allow competitors to
OL,20,Ftake part in a category that matches
OL,21,Ftheir biological sex recorded at birth.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G1/8
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat SportCNat Radio FWeather
FL,304,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30302
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F303A1764248508
OL,3,CUK weightlifter named world's
OL,4,Cstrongest woman as trans winner
OL,5,Cdisqualified
OL,7,FOn Monday, officials said they had
OL,8,Fdiscovered that an athlete who was
OL,9,F"biologically male and who now
OL,10,Fidentifies as female" competed in the
OL,11,FWomen's Open category, and that they
OL,12,Fhad now "disqualified the athlete in
OL,13,Fquestion".
OL,15,FSpeaking to ITV News Anglia, mother-of-
OL,16,Ftwo Ms Thompson described the last few
OL,17,Fdays as "draining".
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G2/8
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat SportCNat Radio FWeather
FL,304,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30303
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F303A1764248508
OL,3,CUK weightlifter named world's
OL,4,Cstrongest woman as trans winner
OL,5,Cdisqualified
OL,7,F"It's definitely been a rollercoaster,
OL,8,Flet's put it that way," she said.
OL,9,F"It's frustrating, it's happy, lots of
OL,10,Femotions. I'm quite drained now.
OL,12,F"I got a call at 9am the next day
OL,13,Fafter the competition. They were
OL,14,Fcongratulating me.
OL,16,F"There was no real celebration.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G3/8
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat SportCNat Radio FWeather
FL,304,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30304
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F303A1764248508
OL,3,CUK weightlifter named world's
OL,4,Cstrongest woman as trans winner
OL,5,Cdisqualified
OL,7,F"Obviously, I'm pleased with the title
OL,8,Fbut having that moment on the podium
OL,9,Fwhere you celebrate your title and the
OL,10,Fwin, it wasn't there for me, so I
OL,11,Fcouldn't have the feelings of
OL,12,Fexcitement that should've been there."
OL,14,FShe added that she and the organisers
OL,15,Fhad no reason to suspect anything.
OL,17,F"Every woman is welcome, so having
OL,18,Fsomeone who is a little bit taller, a
OL,19,Fbit bigger, we just thought this is a
OL,20,Fnew face and we welcome them," she
OL,21,Fsaid.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G4/8
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat SportCNat Radio FWeather
FL,304,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30305
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F303A1764248508
OL,3,CUK weightlifter named world's
OL,4,Cstrongest woman as trans winner
OL,5,Cdisqualified
OL,7,FShe said she intended speak to her
OL,8,Fcompetitor.
OL,10,F"I have wanted to reach out to her
OL,11,Fjust because she's a human being at
OL,12,Fthe end of the day and I suspect she's
OL,13,Freceived a lot of backlash from this
OL,14,Fbut again, I'm also very annoyed with
OL,15,Fwhat she's done and the dishonesty and
OL,16,Fcloud that's been brought onto our
OL,17,Fsport."
OL,19,FOfficials at Strongman said an
OL,20,Finvestigation had been launched.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G5/8
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat SportCNat Radio FWeather
FL,304,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30306
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F303A1764248508
OL,3,CUK weightlifter named world's
OL,4,Cstrongest woman as trans winner
OL,5,Cdisqualified
OL,7,F"Had we been aware, or had this been
OL,8,Fdeclared at any point before or during
OL,9,Fthe competition, this athlete would
OL,10,Fnot have been permitted to compete in
OL,11,Fthe Women's Open category," a
OL,12,Fstatement on its website said.
OL,14,F"We are clear - competitors can only
OL,15,Fcompete in the category for the
OL,16,Fbiological sex recorded at birth.
OL,17,FOfficial Strongman is inclusive and
OL,18,Fproud to run events that do not
OL,19,Fdiscriminate against athletes based on
OL,20,Fpersonal characteristics.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G6/8
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat SportCNat Radio FWeather
FL,304,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30307
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F303A1764248508
OL,3,CUK weightlifter named world's
OL,4,Cstrongest woman as trans winner
OL,5,Cdisqualified
OL,7,F"Any athlete is welcome. But it is our
OL,8,Fresponsibility to ensure fairness and
OL,9,Fensure athletes are assigned to men's
OL,10,For women's categories based on whether
OL,11,Fthey are recorded as male or female at
OL,12,Fbirth.
OL,14,F"The Official Strongman World
OL,15,FChampionships is an event which is
OL,16,Frightly one of the pinnacles of the
OL,17,Fstrength world.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G7/8
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat SportCNat Radio FWeather
FL,304,300,200,120,000,100
PN,30308
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F303A1764248508
OL,3,CUK weightlifter named world's
OL,4,Cstrongest woman as trans winner
OL,5,Cdisqualified
OL,7,F"We are disappointed on behalf of all
OL,8,Fthose who fairly and legitimately took
OL,9,Fpart that the attention has been taken
OL,10,Faway from their efforts, which deserve
OL,11,Fcelebration, no matter how they
OL,12,Fperformed or where they finished. We
OL,13,Fstand with them and stand with
OL,14,Ffairness."
